5. DC Super Heroes Superman & Batman Action Figures, Multicolor - Whether you're a fan of the classic Superman vs. Batman showdown or just want to add some iconic superheroes to your collection, these action figures are a great choice. Featuring two of the most recognizable superheroes in the DC Universe, these figures come in multiple colors and are sure to please any fan.

